  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Ghiona</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient mountain of Aetolia, known today as Giona. Some ancient sources, echoed or interpreted by modern commentators, seem also to include or alternately identify the nearby mountain known today as Vardousia, although most recent scholarship rejects this notion. A peak of Vardousia (\u0392\u03b1\u03c1\u03b4\u03bf\u03cd\u03c3\u03b9\u03b1) seems to have acquired variants of the name \"Korax\" in modern times.",
